#bin/Dockerfile only needs bin/apt_cross.sh: the sources and toolchains are
#bind-mounted at run time, so the build context must not carry the checkout
#(or the downloaded toolchains, or the ~2.5GB NDK) into the daemon. This is a
#per-Dockerfile ignore (BuildKit picks it up next to `-f bin/Dockerfile`), so
#the root .dockerignore keeps its rules for the legacy x64 debug image.
*
!bin
bin/*
!bin/apt_cross.sh
